      en: ["Home to the Royal Andalusian School of Equestrian Art.", "Features a major Moorish fortress (Alcazar).", "Host city for the Spanish motorcycle Grand Prix (MotoGP).", "The name 'Jerez' derives from the Arabic 'Xerez'."],
